n.\n\n**X-AI Summary**\nIt interpreted the result as a high-confidence benign nevus. Suggested next steps: **see a dermatologist for definitive confirmation**, and **consider biopsy if the lesion is changing in size, shape, or color, or if there is concern for malignancy**.\n\n**Important**\nThis is a **preliminary pipeline signal, not a diagnosis**. If this spot is new, evolving, bleeding, painful, irregular, or clinically worrying, it should still be checked by a dermatologist.\n\nMEDIA:http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/admin/retrieve-image-file/nodes_bucket/626130f7c71f6b9e651c76be/69be3b4593ce5ab1f19b2cfb/dd6e811d-0db7-4b50-bd67-0f3eb69e720e.jpg","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08bdb68f23c8bfbe0169ef07e8b3408191bd5d0c80118d29b8\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":11370,"output":337,"cacheRead":17408,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29115,"cost":{"input":0.028425000000000002,"output":0.0050550000000000005,"cacheRead":0.004352,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.037832000000000005}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777272805213,"responseId":"resp_08bdb68f23c8bfbe0169ef07e583ec81918ccb517232a39605"}}
